AndroidRuntime: register the natives Andruna builds, without HWUI and libbinder.

Under ANDRUNA, the JNI registration table comes from andruna_reg_jni.inc
(aosp/modules/libandroid_runtime.cmake writes it for the sources that are
built), the graphics natives (init_android_graphics) are not initialized and
runtime_isSensitiveThread does not ask libbinder for a StrictMode policy.
Both are not part of this build yet. Classes whose natives are not
registered throw UnsatisfiedLinkError when a native method is called.

--- a/core/jni/AndroidRuntime.cpp
+++ b/core/jni/AndroidRuntime.cpp
